source: crates/nb-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
notability learn — Study tools: summaries, quizzes, flashcards, TOC quizzes, finish notes, study sessions, Brain Break, syllabus

Usage: notability learn <command>

Commands:
  cards      Flashcards: due, rate, import
  discuss    Brain Break: an AI discussion about the note, turn by turn
  explain    Explain a quiz question
  finish     Finish my notes: AI write-up from the note's text and transcripts, added to the note
  generate   Generate summary/quizzes/flashcards (spends quota)
  materials  Study-material status and contents
  quiz       Quiz sessions: list, start, answer, finish
  session    Guided study session: memorize, practice and test stages, graded answers
  summary    AI summary already generated for a note
  syllabus   Import a syllabus PDF: AI reads the course and dates; creates a course folder with the PDF
  toc        Quizzes from chosen sections of a PDF's table of contents
  wait       Wait for generation to finish (--timeout)

Global Options:
  --filter-output <keys>              Filter output by key paths (e.g. foo,bar.baz,a[0,3])
  --format <toon|json|yaml|md|jsonl>  Output format
  --full-output                       Show full output envelope
  --help                              Show help
  --llms, --llms-full                 Print LLM-readable manifest
  --schema                            Show JSON Schema for command
  --token-count                       Print token count of output (instead of output)
  --token-limit <n>                   Limit output to n tokens
  --token-offset <n>                  Skip first n tokens of output
